<description>A 50 mm flat circular mirror on a compact round tripod.

Three Z actuators sit at 120-degree intervals on the base. The moving
plate follows the plane through their attachment points, with its local Y
axis pointing toward the downstream actuator. The mirror sits flush on
the moving plate.

Run this script to see the mirror pose and reflected spot for lift, pitch,
and roll moves. Set SHOW_3D to True or pass --glow to open xrtGlow.</description>
